/v/t64.5771-25/38974504_999332164037048_8352848161181583365_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0E_1bdfdOpgQ7kNvwFrL3bh&_nc_oc=AdqwOqryO4loPtBFhybEnT051ichkqVqHTVJ30A2r6AWxRBRHgK07ZCNm0ruOJRLQGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPqAiOcm5jzfN1VOFCkymgjjDOH4m9HBBuHXjktuMzsNg&oe=6AE35F79"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom2.png", "id": "1060903411489141", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031501_1060903414822474_9192607785681237416_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Kz36mZsj40IQ7kNvwEsPQTp&_nc_oc=AdpwM6HjvicTj4XI5gcBHNh7TyfKq6TNXcfniyB_myN06yAvZqHzcPHZBEN25bBsaqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMa7w3cd2yS3T3SmtHPFULvDwj2iJGr7ugtJ5vFw9rMoA&oe=6AE338C3"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom3.png", "id": "1333559243720099", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_1333559247053432_5526570972152141129_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uALFzaWkXPwQ7kNvwGhF_UC&_nc_oc=AdqVMTTPW2Y9S2eJA97TheHP0QEljkQSVq-ZsEz-RIzfs8D07DSQzs6M6JYZJlsnbaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP6sF6M03FzT7YiYYvH0RmQPP_GMj5kyhUXS1heXu3OSw&oe=6AE367CE"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom4.png", "id": "403819987828479", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982552_403819991161812_8720327022213224385_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cKv5uBdUJW4Q7kNvwGniflO&_nc_oc=Adp0ti5w6z0GeOyM86EFoiSwbg4i2PIDoQFw9kLwmg0gOi35WAVj_gC_1dBu56HXMRM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMY14WNnN2Ha9aMpO3HY4M1ldFhm_VTuDHRTdQX2XmWIQ&oe=6AE337B3"}, {"file_name": "FireInTheEngineRoom5.png", "id": "397854095192936", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982464_397854098526269_4581865977018394136_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dGMMCcSpuGAQ7kNvwHVI5DM&_nc_oc=Adr3lKeom-SJYLhGoLYWKhLT7-llWyiyksxeHgmY5-DAkdMoXigbKI3u9juCbPMrDAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMA9DckI8OdlNcI5Jn0iHO5_3uzyXrg7JqhK8hL24v_tQ&oe=6AE3693B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR-ME: Fire In The Engine Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In the script of the scenario \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb after some welding work in the engine room, a fire starts in the bilge of the engine room, also spreading to the main electrical panel.The \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app includes actions mentioned below that are urgent at the situation of fire:\n\n-Go to the meeting point. Recount\n\n-Grab, carry and put on \ufb01re \ufb01ghter equipment, prove function     and adjustment\n\n-Grab one \ufb01re extinguisher and put it ready for use.\n\n-Going to the engine control room and trying to su\ufb00ocate the \ufb01re, with a \ufb01re  extinguisher.                          \n\nThe development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project.", "short_description": "\u00abVR-ME: Fire in the Engine Room\u00bb app is about an emergency situation when you\u2019re working onboard a vessel that is out to sea, an engine fire is one of the last things you want to deal with.Engine room fires also obviously put a ship filled with maritime workers at risk of injury or death. The development of the \u00abFire in the Engine Room_VR-ME\u00bb app is co-funded by the Erasmus+ Programme of the European Union under the framework of the Virtual Reality for Maritime Emergencies (VR-ME) project."}]}, "developer_name": "SQLearn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sqlearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "The consortium of the VR-ME project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr-me.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating":